~ start
do freezePlayer()
You: The stairway seems to be blocked by a wall of flesh from wall to wall,[wait=0.3] it feels dry agasint your fingers.
- Spill Orange Mixture [if Player.instance.inventoryContents.has("FleshBurningMixture") == true]
	do destory(fleshWall, null)
	do destory(meatwall_1, null)
	do destory(meatwall_2, null)
	do destory(fleshwall_actionable, actionables)
	do SaveLoad.SaveFileData.burned_away_flesh = true
	You: As the mixture ignites the flesh burns away instintaniously,[wait=0.3] the path up opened.
- Spill Mixture [if Player.instance.inventoryContents.has("Mixture") == true]
	% You: You spill it to no effect
	% You: It bubbles softly on the flesh with no effect
	do unfreezePlayer()
	=> END
- Back
	do unfreezePlayer()
	=> END
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END